        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-025923",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-10",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "As a result of our acquisition of Pathfinder in 2013, we own the Shirley Basin Project, from which Pathfinder and its predecessors historically produced more than 28 million pounds U3O8, primarily from the 1960s until the early 1990s.",
        "start_character": 43107,
        "end_character": 43341
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-025923",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-025923-c0135a11b99cce95",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-025923",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-10",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "As indicated above, following a ramp-up decision, we began selling into newly obtained sales agreements in 2023.",
        "start_character": 4513,
        "end_character": 4625
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-025923",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-025923-c0135a11b99cce95",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-025923",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-10",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In 2025, we began our development drilling at the project and increased our drill contractors to the current eight rigs.",
        "start_character": 52589,
        "end_character": 52709
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-025923",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-025923-c0135a11b99cce95",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-025923",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-10",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In 2025, we continued our ramp-up of operations at Lost Creek, with additional development drilling in MU2 and MU1 Phase 2, and delineation drilling and monitor well installation in MU5.",
        "start_character": 22436,
        "end_character": 22622
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-025923",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-025923-c0135a11b99cce95",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-025923",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-10",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Incorporated on March 22, 2004, we are engaged in uranium mining, recovery and processing activities, including the acquisition, exploration, development and operation of uranium mineral properties in the U.S.",
        "start_character": 72,
        "end_character": 281
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-025923",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-025923-c0135a11b99cce95",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-025923",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-10",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "The Main and Lower Sands of the Wind River Formation are the primary hosts to mineralization which we are currently developing for ISR production.",
        "start_character": 57221,
        "end_character": 57367
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-025923",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-025923-c0135a11b99cce95",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-025923",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-10",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "To further reduce water consumption and enhance IX effectiveness, engineering work has progressed for a filtration and wastewater treatment facility, which we plan to construct in 2026 after detailed design work is complete.",
        "start_character": 9187,
        "end_character": 9411
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-025923",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-025923-c0135a11b99cce95",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-025923",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-10",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Together with these mineral rights, we control 280 acres of additional surface access rights necessary to develop the project.",
        "start_character": 47259,
        "end_character": 47385
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-025923",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-025923-c0135a11b99cce95",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-025923",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-10",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We are engaged in uranium recovery and processing operations, and the exploration for and development of uranium mineral properties.",
        "start_character": 1960,
        "end_character": 2092
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-025923",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-025923-c0135a11b99cce95",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-025923",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-10",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We focused our development drilling during the year in MU1 Phase 2 which is being brought online in 2026 for recovery from the initial header houses.",
        "start_character": 21465,
        "end_character": 21614
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-025923",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-025923-c0135a11b99cce95",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-025923",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-10",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "While we continued to face challenges of recruitment and retention in hiring for Lost Creek, we are experiencing stronger retention and are building a core group, including managers, which allows for more complete training and a more robust safety culture.",
        "start_character": 84816,
        "end_character": 85072
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-025923",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-025923-c0135a11b99cce95",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-025923",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-10",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "With stronger retention, we will strive to fill openings through the growth and professional development of our current qualified employees, as appropriate.",
